* RMII 50MHz Signal Integrity — LTspice
* Driver: 8mA LVCMOS, 1.2ns rise, 65mm stripline
Vdrv drv 0 PULSE(0 3.3 0 1.2n 1.2n 8n 20n)
Rsrc drv n1 33
T1 n1 0 n2 0 Z0=50 TD=0.42n  ; 65mm, Er 4.3
Rload n2 0 10k
Cload n2 0 5p
.tran 0 100n 0 10p
.meas TRAN eye_height MAX V(n2) TRIG time=40n TARG time=50n
.end
